# Minehut's shipped production CSS, kept locally as the reference for real class
# names and token values. Deliberately NOT committed: it is their copyrighted
# output and does not belong in an MIT-licensed repo.
#
# The audit gate does not need the CSS itself, only the list of class NAMES, which
# is committed as tools/bundle-tokens.txt. Both audit scripts fall back to it
# automatically when this folder is absent.
#
# To refresh: download the _next/static/css/*.css bundles from
# dashboard.minehut.com into this folder, then run
#   python tools/audit-selectors.py --write-tokens
# and update the @note bundle hash in section 01 of the stylesheet.
